WEBVTT

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:00.896
and that we can grow food successfully.

00:15:02.105 --> 00:15:04.107
They are home to biodiversity.

00:15:05.025 --> 00:15:07.819
They are also home to indigenous people

00:15:07.819 --> 00:15:12.491
who protect them
with their blood, sweat and tears.

00:15:14.117 --> 00:15:16.828
So when we lose these ecosystems,

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.622
the livelihoods of local communities

00:15:18.622 --> 00:15:21.750
and Indigenous people
are adversely affected.

00:15:22.042 --> 00:15:25.629
When you look at the way
we designed the carbon markets,

00:15:25.671 --> 00:15:28.799
we designed them with various assumptions.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.550
First of all,